<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Projet Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="toc3">Khl</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kholosayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda kwena bisi Kholosayi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda kwena bisi Kholosayi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kholosayi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Kholosayi, mbanza yimosi yenina kuna ndamba ya Aziya dya Khunda, Tidiki dya buthwena. Hangambedi ni Pholu khaniku kedi kenda kinda kimvuka kya bakidisitu kya mbanza meni yayina. Kimvuka meni kyakina, báyidikaya kwena Ephafwasi wuna wákala phi mwisi Kholosayi, mosi wa banduku bandi ba kisalu (1:7; 4:12). Pholu káyuka ni bakidisitu babati bahuna kwena batu muna Dibundu dya Kholosayi. Babati hana malongi mana maswaswani yi Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu Kidisitu. Babati lomba kwena bisi Kholosayi ni balanda mikuku mya bawu mina mya khulu, amana phi basambilaka ngolu za hika zina zisi hanga mihangu mu tsi. Bwosu kákala Pholu mu boloku (4:3,10,18) bwalenda kala ni ku Loma, kakhanaku lenda mu kutula ku Kholosayi; yi hakana kábasonikinina mukanda wawu.</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda kwena bisi Kholosayi wubati songila kifwanisu kya Kidisitu, disongidila ni wuna kásola Nzambi amana phi wámutuma ndangu kahulula batu ba tsi. Kuna Kholosayi, batu benina yi bweya bwa lawu kikuma kya bipfumu bya batu bina byisiku mona, kaasi byenina yi hamu muna tsi.</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="ip">Kinga, Kidisitu ngolu kenina kuhita ngolu zina. Mu kufwa kwandi ha kitakani, wákatula kipfumu kya bawu ku mitsoki mya batu. Amana Nzambi wákatula kipfumu kya bawu ku ngolu zoosu yi ku ngolu zina zihitini, mu kuhana luzingu kwena Kidisitu, Mwana wandi. Kidisitu kenina phi mutwa wa Dibundu; dyawu dyenina hanga lutu luna báyidika yi bakwikidi boosu. Muna mbotika ya bawu, bakwikidi bisi dihanina ku lufwa yi luzingu lwa Kidisitu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Muna ndambu ya theti ya mukanda (1:1—2:5), mukunga wumosi wálumisa Kidisitu hanga Pfumu wa tsi yi wa Dibundu (1:15-20). Ku thwala ya mukunga meni wawuna kwenina yi kisambu kikuma kya bisi Kholosayi (1:3-14). Ku nima dya mukunga meni wawuna, Pholu kabati bambukisa muzingu wandi ku kisalu kya Dibundu (1:24—2:5.)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kunima, musoniki wa mukanda wuzimbudi kwena bakidisitu ba Kholosayi ni badikenga (2:6-23). Bafwaniku ni bayuka batu babana bisi longa mabanza ma mbi, kaasi bakala muna lukwikilu meni luna bátambula.</para>
  <para style="io1">Ku tsuka, mukanda wubati hana ndongisila kikuma kya kunata luzingu lwa pha muna dingumba, muna kikanda yi muna bikhunda (3:1—4:6).</para>
  <para style="io1">Mukanda wumanisini mu mboti (4:7-18).</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="ip">Tsangu za mukanda kwena bisi Kholosayi babatiza sadila yi kuna lelu dyadi. Kidisitu kabati katula batu ba tsi ku ngolu zoosu za bambeni. Kabati bakatula phi ku mambu moosu mana misi bakabisa yi kubahambula. Kinga, Kidisitu, yandi kaka wáyala.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Pholu, thumwa wa Kidisitu Yesu muna luzolu lwa Nzambi yi phangi Thimoti.<verse eid="COL 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>Kwena batu ba Nzambi, baphangi babana bisi sila mbundu mwena Kidisitu benina ku Kholosayi: Nzambi Tata wetu kaluheka khenda yi ngemba.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pholu vutudini matondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Tuvutudini matondu kwena Nzambi, Tata wa Pfumu wetu Yesu Kidisitu, amana thwisi lombila konda kulembwa kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Kikuma, twayukà mu kuzonzila lukwikilu lwenu mwena Kidisitu Yesu amana yi lungongu luna lwenina lwawu kikuma kya batu ba Nzambi boosu. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Mukuma, lwisi sya kivuvu mu mana kaluyidikila Nzambi muna mazilu. Tangwa lwayuka ndinga ya kyedika, Musamu wa Bukheti, ha watula kwa benu, wuluzayikisi kivuvu kyakina<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Ko 13:13.</char></note>. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Musamu wa Bukheti wawu wátula yi kuna lwena benu, bwosu buna wubutini bibundu wuyalanganini muna tsi ya muthu, phila mosi kwena benu, tukidila buna lwáyuka amana lwázaya khenda za Nzambi mu kyedika. <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Musamu wa Bukheti wawu lwabongilawa kwena Ephafwasi, nduku wetu wa kisalu, kenina musadi wa Kidisitu walunga kikuma kya benu. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>Amana, yandi wátumenika mutindu wa lungongu luna káluheka Kitembu.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Yi hakana, betu phi, tuka kilumbu kina twáyukilabwa, thwisiku lembwa mu kulombila Nzambi kikuma kya benu, mu kulomba phi ni lwakala babasa mu nzayilu ya luzolu lwandi, muna mudimu wosu yi ngangu za mu kitembu. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Ndangu lwadyatilaka mu mutindu wuna kazodini Pfumu, ndangu twamusephidisaka bwosu buna kyisi zola mu mambu moosu; lwabuta bibundu muna mitindu mya mihangu myosu mya bukheti, lwakola muna nzayilu ya Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Amana lwakituka yi ngolu mu mitindu myosu muna ngolu zandi za khembu, ndangu lwakwaminaka mu kyesi yi sipha dya mbundu ku kimeka kyosu. <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>Vutulenu matondu kwena Tata wuna wálukitula batu bana balungini mu kubonga ndambu ya kimvwama kina káswekila batu ba Nzambi muna luyalu lwa mwini. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Yandi wátukatula ku hamu dya mudima mu kutunata muna luyalu lwa Mwana wandi watondama; <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>mwena yandi tuvwidini luhulusu yi ndoluka ya masumu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efs 1:7.</char></note>.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mutu yi muhangu wa Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Kidisitu kenina kifwani kya Nzambi wuna wisiku monika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:15">Mwana wa tsomi muna bihangwa byosu.<verse eid="COL 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Mukuma mwena yandi byáhangamina bima byosu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">muna mazilu yi hana tsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">bina byisi monika yi bina byisiku monika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">biti bya luyalu, bipfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">ngolu za luyalu lwa mbi, hamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:16">byosu byáhangamina mwena yandi yi kikuma kya yandi.<verse eid="COL 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Amana Kidisitu kenina ku thwala ya kima kyosu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:17">amana mwena yandi byisi zyamina bima byosu.<verse eid="COL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>Yandi kenina mutwa wa lutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">lutu, lwaluna lwenina Dibundu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">Kenina luyandiku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">mwana wa tsomi hana kati dya bafwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:18">ndangu kakala wa theti muna bima byosu.<verse eid="COL 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Mukuma Nzambi kyesi kámonabwa ni bunzambi bwandi bwosu bwakadila mwena yandi Kidisitu<verse eid="COL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>amana muna nzila ya Mwana wandi, wávutula kithwadi ha kati dya bima byosu yi yandi-meni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:20">byakala bina byenina ha tsi holo phi bina byenina mu mazilu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:20">tangwa kasya ngemba mu nzila ya menga ma Mwana wandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="COL 1:20">mana kátyaka hana kitakani.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Amana kwena benu lwákala theti kyana yi Nzambi, lwákala bambeni bandi muna mutindu wa mabanza menu yi muna mihangu myenu mya mbi. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Amana buthwena, Nzambi, wávutula kithwadi ha kati dya benu yi yandi, muna nzila ya lufwa lwa mu lutu lwa Mwana wandi, ndangu kalunata benu ku thwala ya yandi: batu ba Nzambi, bakonda kifu, bakonda keti dyambu dya kulufundila. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Yi hakana ni, yuka lwazingilaka mu lukwikilu, bazyama amana ba kutunga buna bufwanini. Konda kudiyambwadila ni baluhukumuna mu kivuvu kina lwábonga tangwa lwáyuka Musamu wa Bukheti. Musamu wa Bukheti meni wuna básamuna kwena bihangwa byosu bina byisi zingila mu sina dya zilu, amana kuna wawuna, meni Pholu, yíkitwakila musadi.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minyanga mya thumwa Pholu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Buthwena, mbati sangwala muna minyanga myama mina mbati mona kikuma kya benu. Amana, muna lutu lwa meni, ndungisini kina kikondini ku biwayi bya Kidisitu kikuma lutu lwandi luna lwenina Dibundu. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Ku Dibundu yíkitwakila musadi, bwosu bwenina kiyeka kina kápheka Nzambi kikuma kya benu: ndangu yisamuna ndinga ya Nzambi buna bufwanini. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Diswekamu meni dina dyáswekama muna matangwa moosu yi kwena makula moosu, kaasi buthwena, dimonikini kwena bakwikidi. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Kwena bawu kázola Nzambi kuzayikisa kutoka kwa kimvwama kya khembu kina kitadidini diswekamu meni dyadina kikuma kya bana bakondi kala Bayuta. Amana diswekamu meni dyadina dyenina: kidisitu mwena benu, kivuvu kya khembu. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Yandi wuna thwisi samuna, mu kulwengisaka mutu wosu yi mu kulongaka kwena mutu wosu, muna mudimu wosu, ndangu twalenda mu kukitula mutu wosu, mutu walunga mwena Kidisitu. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Kyakina kikuma yisi dihekila phasi, mu kunwaninaka muna ngolu zina zisi tuka kwena yandi, zisi sala mwena meni yi ngolu zoosu.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Kikuma nzodini lwazaya ni muzingu wa mbuta mbati nwana kikuma kya benu, kikuma kya bakidisitu ba ku Lawodise yi kikuma kya bahika babana khaku kedi bambona mu kimwesa mutu. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Ndangu babaheka kikesa, bakala kithwadi muna lungongu. Amana bakala boosu babasa mu ngangu, kikuma kya kuzaya diswekamu dya Nzambi, disongidila ni yandi-meni Kidisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Mwena yandi mwaswamana bima bya thalu byosu bya mudimu yi bya mazaya. <verse eid="COL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Nzimbudini bwabuna mu kusya ni baluhunaku kwena mutu mosi mu lengu ndinga. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Mukuma, ho kyana yenina mu kimutu, mu kitembu, ha kimosi yenina yenu. Mu kyesi yenina, mu kumona ni, kwena benu moosu misi hitila mu ndonga; amana lukwikilu lwenu kwena Kidisitu, lwenina lwazyama ngolu.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luzingu lwa lunga mwena Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Kikuma, bwosu lutambudini Kidisitu Yesu, Pfumu, dyatilenu mwena yandi. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Zikenu misodi mwena yandi, amana tungenu luzingu lwenu hana thandu ya yandi. Disyamisakenu muna lukwikilu, muna mutindu wa mamana bálulonga, amana vutulakenu matondu ma lawu kwena Nzambi kosu tangwa.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Dikengenu, ka mutu ku kalukwata ha mutambu ku nduka za mbi, amana za phamba. Bwenina bukamvi kwandi, bwisi zyamina ku mikuku mya batu, bwosu zenina ngolu za bitembu bya tsi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngl 4:3. </char></note>, kaasi bweku mutindu mosi yi mana kazodini Kidisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Mukuma, mwena Kidisitu mwisi zingila lutu lwa bunzambi bwandi bwosu. <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Amana benu lwenina babasa mwena Kidisitu, yandi wenina mutwa wa kipfumu kyosu yi luyalu lwosu.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Mwena Kidisitu lwákotila benu phi mukhanda wuna wákonda hangamina ku moku ma batu. Kaasi mukhanda meni wuna mu nzila ya Kidisitu wáhangamina, amana wawuna wulukutumunini benu mu kihika kya lutu lwa masumu. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Báluzika yi Kidisitu muna nzila ya mbotika, lwáfutumuka phi ha kimosi mwena yandi, muna lukwikilu lwa ngolu zoosu za Nzambi wuna wámufutumuna ha kati dya bafwa<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lom 6:4. </char></note>. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Amana benu lwákala bafwa kikuma kya mitsoki myenu, yi kikuma kya bungulungwa bwa lutu lwenu, Nzambi wálufutumuna ha kimosi yi Kidisitu, mu kulolula mitsoki myetu myosu. <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>Wáyatawa mukanda wuna wakala tufundaka yi mikuku mya wawu, amana wákatulawa mu kukhokawa hana kitakani. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Nzambi wáwongumuna bipfumu bya bitembu yi luyalu; wálubulabya ha tseki amana wábulumunabya hanga bakwatami muna kinunga kya Mwana wandi.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Yi hakana ni, ka mutu ku kalufundisa ku kina lwisi dya yi kina lwisi nwa, kondi loni kikuma kya kyufu kitadidini mukinzi wa ngonda ya pha kondi loni yi mukinzi wa Sabata. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Byosu bina byenina kininga kya mana menina mu kukwisa, kaasi kyedika kya mawu kibati monikina muna lutu lwa Kidisitu. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Luyambwadilaku ni balufundisa kwena batu bana bisi sanda mu kudikulumuna mu mambu mana misi monika amana bisi sambila banzyo. Bisi dihana ku ndosi za bawu. Amana mabanza ma bawu ma kimutu misi babasisa mu kimvunya kya phamba; <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>amana bisiku simbidila kwena Kidisitu yandi wenina mutwa. Tuka kwena yandi, lutu lwosu lwákhundakanina bwa bukheti muna bikhosu yi muna misuni myisi dikwatila ha kimosi. Nzambi wisi kodisa lutu lwaluna.<verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa yi kuzinga ha kimosi yi Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Ho ni lwáfwa kedi yi Kidisitu mu mambu ma bitembu bya tsi, kikuma kya biki lubati zingila hangambedi ni ku moku ma tsi hika lwenina, mu kutambwasaka ni baluhekaka mitsiku mya mutindu wawuna<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngl 4:3. </char></note>: <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>«Wubongaku kyaki», «Wuyedikakyoku», «Wusimbaku kina». <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Bima bina byosu byátangamina mu kuzangana ku manima ma tsadidi ya byawu. Byenina bizila yi malongi ma kimutu. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Mukyedika, bizila bya mutindu meni wuna, byisi monika hangambedi ni bya kabasi yi mudimu. Mukuma, bulombini ni batu basambila muna mutindu wuna bazodini bawu meni, bakala yi kudikulumuna kwa luvunu; amana badihekaka phasi muna lutu. Kaasi, bizila byabina byeku keti mupfunu, kaka kikuma kya kusephidisaka lwesi tsambu za lutu.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Amana honi benu lwátokama ku lufwa yi Kidisitu, sandakenu bima bya mu zilu, kwakuna kazakadini Kidisitu kuna koku dya kitata dya Nzambi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkg 110:1. </char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Banzakenu ku bima bina byenina mu zilu, kaasi ka byabi ku byenina ha tsi. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Mukuma benu lwáfwa, amana luzingu lwenu lwaswekama lwenina hakimosi yi Kidisitu mwena Nzambi. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Kilumbu kamónika, Kidisitu yandi wenina luzingu lwenu, hanga benu phi lumoniki hika yi yandi muna khembu.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luzingu lwa khulu yi luzingu lwa pha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Yi hakana ni, hondenu miza myosu mya ha tsi mina myenina mwena benu: mbongi, mambu ma mvindu, tsambu, nzoluka za mbi yi lukusu luna lwenina kufukamina kwa nzambi za biteki. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Yi hakana khabu za Nzambi zisi kwisila kwena bandwandwa. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Theti, benu phi, bwabuna lwakala dyatila, tangwa lwákala luzingu lwenu mu sina dya bima byabina.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Kaasi, buthwena benu phi, losenu bikalulu bina byosu: khabu, bumbisi, khu, kuhuna misamu, ndinga za khadi zina zilubukini muna munwa wenu. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Ludihunakaku benu yi benu: mukuma benu lwálosa kedi mutu wa khulu yi mihangu myandi; <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>amana lwávwata mutu wa pha, wuna wukitukini wa pha muna nzayilu, bwosu bwenina kifwani kya Muhangi wandi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuy 1:26. </char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Buthwena, kweku hika ni Mungeleki, keti Muyuta, keti wuna wakota mukhanda, keti ngulungu, keti musenzi, keti mutu wálonguka, keti muhika, keti mutu wa kiphwanza, kaasi Kidisitu kenina wa muthu muna byosu.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Yi bwabuna ni, benu básola kwena Nzambi, batu ba Nzambi yi batu batondama; vwatenu tsambu ya kyedika, buweti, kudikulumuna, lembami yi sipha dya mbundu. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Ditambwasakenu benu yi benu; yuka mutu kanyengalakana kikuma kya mukwawu, difwilakenu khenda bwosu buna kálufwila Pfumu khenda. Benu phi, hangenu bwabuna<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 6:12. 14. </char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Amana hana thandu ya byosu, vwatenu lungongu, mukuma lwenina zita dya mukwandi dya kikhunda. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Yambula ngemba ya Kidisitu, yina kálutedila Nzambi mu kukala bitini bya lutu lumosi, yayala muna mbundu zenu. Zayakenu mu kuvutula matondu. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Yambula ndinga ya Kidisitu yi kimvwama kyandi kyosu yazingila mwena benu. Dilongenu amana dilwengisenu benu yi benu muna mudimu wosu, muna mikunga, muna mikunga mya khembu yi mikunga mya mu kitembu. Muna khenda, muyimbidilenu Nzambi yi mbundu yenu yosu<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efs 5:19-20. </char></note>. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Amana kyosu kima kina luhangini, mu ndinga kondi loni mu mihangu, hangenukya mu zina dya Pfumu Yesu, mu kuvutulaka matondu mu nzila ya yandi kwena Nzambi Tata.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bayakala yi bakhetu, bana yi bibuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Bakhetu, lemvukenu kwena bayakala benu, bwosu bulombini mwena Pfumu.<verse eid="COL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Bayala, zolenu bakhetu benu, amana lulubulaku phisi kwena bawu.<verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Bana, lemvukenu mu byosu kwena bibuti byenu, mukuma yi bwabuna bwisi musephidisa Pfumu.<verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Batata, lukwatisaku bana benu khabu, hanga bakatula nana kikesa.<verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapfumu yi basadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Basadi, lemvukenu mu byosu kwena bapfumu benu muna kimutu. Luhangilabwoku lwesi mu mesu ma bawu, hangambedi ni kikuma kya kuditondisa kwena batu. Kaasi yi mbundu ya bulemvu, muna bweya bwa Pfumu. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Kyosu kina lwisi hanga, hangenukya yi mbundu yenu yosu, hangambedi ni kikuma kya Pfumu lubatikya hangila, kaasi ka kikuma kya batu ku. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Zayenu ni lwatámbula kuvwa hanga lufutu kwena Pfumu. Basadilenu hanga bahika ba Pfumu wa mukwandi, Kidisitu. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Mukuma wuna wisi yenguna, kafútama muna kayengu kana kahangini, Nzambi kisiku swasisa batu<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Klg 10:17. </char></note>.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Bapfumu, bahangilenu basadi benu buna bwenina bwa masonga yi bwalunga. Bambukenu ni benu phi, Pfumu mosi lwenina yandi muna zilu.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Dihanakenu kosu tangwa mu bisambu, kadilakenu mu kitsungila muna nzila ya byawu, muna kuvutula kwa matondu. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Sambilakenu phi kikuma kya betu, ndangu Nzambi katuyafwadila mwelu kikuma kya kulonga Ndinga. Ndangu twasamuna diswekamu dya Kidisitu. Kikuma kya dyawu dina yenina mu boloku. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Amana sambilakenu ndangu yizonziladya wengele bwosu buna ndungini mu kuzonzilabwa.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Dyatilakenu muna mudimu kwena babana bakondi kala Bayuta; sadilenu tangwa. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Yambula ndinga zenu, kosu tangwa, zakalaka yi khenda yi munzenzu wa mungwa; ndangu lwazaya buna bulungini mu kuvutula mvutu kwena mutu yi mutu.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mboti za tsuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Muna mambu mana mathadidini, Tisiki<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mhb 20:4; Efs 6:21-22. </char></note>, phangi wenina mwena Pfumu, phangi watondama, musadi wa kusila mbundu, nduku wa kisalu kya kihika, kalúmenikina moosu. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Yiluhitiki yandi yi tswatsu yosu mu kusya ni lwazaya buna thwenina betu, amana ndangu kalubwisa mbundu. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Nzila mosi yimuhitikini yi Onezimi phangi watondama, wa kusila mbundu, mutu wa ku hata dyenu. Balúmenikina moosu mana mabati hita kwaku.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Adisitadiki, mukwetu nduku wama wa boloku, mboti kaluhekini, yi Malaku, kiwutu kya Balanabasi. Lubongikini mikuku mitadidi Malaku: honi kisa lutala, muyambenu bukheti. <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Amana Yesu wuna bisi tela ni Yusitusi, mboti kaluheki phi. Hana kati dya batu bana bákota mukhanda, bawu lwesi bisi yukana yi meni kikuma kya Kipfumu kya Nzambi; bawu baphekiki kikesa kya lawu.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Ephafwasi wenina mosi wa benu, mboti kaluhekini; muhika wa Kidisitu Yesu, kisiku lembwa mu kunwanaka kikuma kya benu muna bisambu byandi; ndangu lwazyama, lwabasa yi kikumbwala mu kulungisa, buna bulungi, luzolu lwa Nzambi, amana lwatelama bwa bukheti. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Mbati mutila kimbangi ni kisi diheka phasi lawu kikuma kya benu, kikuma kya bakidisitu ba mbanza ya Lawodise yi kikuma kya bakidisitu ba mbanza ya Yelaphodisi. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Luka, munganga watondama, mboti kaluhekini yi Temasi, yandi phi.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Bahekenu mboti baphangi bana benina ku mbanza ya Lawodise, mutindu mosi phi Nimifwa yi Dibundu dina dyenina muna nzu yandi. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Kilumbu watángama mukanda wawu kwena benu, hangenu phila yosu ni watangama phi ku Dibundu dya mbanza ya Lawodise. Amana benu, mutindu mosi, lwatanga mukanda wuna walúyisila ku mbanza ya Lawodise. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Muzimbwalenu Adisiphi: «Keba kisyelu kyaki wátambula mwena Pfumu ndangu walungisakya buna bwa bukheti.»<verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Mboti yiluhekini, meni Pholu, yi koku dyama: -Sungulakenu ni meni mu miyololu yenina. -Yambula ngemba yakala yi benu.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
